---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the Privacy Policy of the Offa Descendants Chief Lecturers' Forum (ODCLF).">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- Back Link -->
    <a 
      href="/" 
      class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-800 transition-colors mb-8 group"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-200">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5 3 12m0 0 7.5-7.5M3 12h18" />
      </svg>
      Back to Home
    </a>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="space-y-2 mb-8 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: August 20, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <p>
        The Offa Descendants Chief Lecturers' Forum (ODCLF) ("we", "our", "us") operates this website. We are committed to protecting the privacy and personal data of our members, academics, and website visitors. This Privacy Policy outlines what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights concerning your personal data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect personal information that you provide to us directly or through our content editors:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Member Directory Details</strong>: Name, academic role, institutional affiliation, biography, photographs, contact emails, and phone numbers.</li>
        <li><strong>Academic Contributions</strong>: Names and affiliations associated with uploaded publications, research papers, and journals.</li>
        <li><strong>Inquiries</strong>: Any correspondence or personal details you provide when contacting us via email.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the collected information for the following purposes:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>To maintain and display the ODCLF Member Directory.</li>
        <li>To publish and showcase research papers, articles, and announcements.</li>
        <li>To communicate forum events, webinars, and conferences.</li>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries or support requests.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">3. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or trade your personal information. We may disclose your information under the following conditions:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Public Directory</strong>: Profile information (name, role, biography, photos, public email lists) is displayed publicly on the website to facilitate academic collaboration.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Obligations</strong>: Where required by applicable law, court orders, or regulations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">4. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
      <p>
        As a member or visitor, you have the right to request updates, corrections, or the removal of your personal information from our public directory. To make a request, please contact the forum administrator.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">5. Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal obligations. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
